				"left": "### We revel in designing buildings that facilitate community connection.",
				"right": "{% regular %}The notion of community is often difficult to pin down but it is never more tangible than it is in places that are designed for us to gather, participate in shared activities and access shared resources.{% /regular %}\n\n{% regular %}From sports pavilions to libraries and other public buildings, we enjoy getting to know user groups and designing flexible, durable and inclusive buildings that facilitate community interactions.{% /regular %}"
